Apologies for the last couple of minutes

00:30:03.715 --> 00:30:05.395
of technical difficulties here

00:30:05.395 --> 00:30:08.005
to all those folks who are listening.

00:30:08.005 --> 00:30:10.475
Mark, thank you so much for joining us

00:30:10.475 --> 00:30:11.475
and thank you for the work

00:30:11.475 --> 00:30:14.785
that you're doing to support learners

00:30:14.785 --> 00:30:17.058
and learning in these times.

